@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava demo korisnika
# @name demo
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "demo@dermawise.rs", "password": "demo123"}

### Flushing pre 5 dana, okidač alkohol
POST {{host}}/api/diary/flushing
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -5 d}}", "durationMinutes": 20, "trigger": "ALKOHOL"}

### Flushing pre 4 dana, okidač toplota
POST {{host}}/api/diary/flushing
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -4 d}}", "durationMinutes": 15, "trigger": "TOPLOTA"}

### Flushing pre 2 dana, okidač alkohol
POST {{host}}/api/diary/flushing
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -2 d}}", "durationMinutes": 25, "trigger": "ALKOHOL"}

### CEP primer 1: četvrta epizoda u 7 dana daje sumnju na ETR rozaceju, treći alkohol u 30 dana je dominantni okidač
POST {{host}}/api/diary/flushing
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -1 d}}", "durationMinutes": 30, "trigger": "ALKOHOL"}

### Peta epizoda iste nedelje ne pravi novu sumnju (guard RosaceaSuspicion ističe tek za 7 dana)
POST {{host}}/api/diary/flushing
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -2 h}}", "durationMinutes": 10, "trigger": "HRANA"}

### Sva CEP upozorenja korisnika
GET {{host}}/api/cep/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
